    {
      "id": "ce5763e7-c891-46cd-895b-ae0415a61c3b",
      "type": "flow:sticky_note",
      "typeVersion": "1.0",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "parameters": {
        "content": "Signup honeytrap. The theme component \"HHF signup honeytrap\" adds decoy inputs to the signup form and writes its signals into the hidden user field \"Signup check\" (user_field_8).\n\n**Trap** (decoy filled, webdriver, tampering): add to \"monitor\", lock TL0, flag the user for review. W22b then hides each of their posts until a moderator approves it.\n\n**Weak** (no script value, very fast, no real input events): flag the user for review only.\n\nSource: hhf-forum-automation themes/signup-honeytrap and docs/workflows/signup-protection.",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 200,
        "color": "blue"
      },
      "credentials": {},
      "webhookId": null,
